                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0d376f12-12d1-3f3c-ab26-a0935058f925",
                        "entry_id": "2397cbe8-adf4-3f65-a360-795e76cb18a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "страд. прич. прош. вр. от подсолить"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "participle"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a81ecad-5d5b-445a-b602-5662ffb5458a",
                                "sense_id": "0d376f12-12d1-3f3c-ab26-a0935058f925",
                                "text": "Ливер (лёгкие, сердце, почки, печень) вымыть; лёгкие, сердце, почки сварить в подсоленной воде, а печень пожарить на сковороде, затем пропустить через мясорубку."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30a5d62a-9dd7-439a-8d14-4a6f01b98070",
                        "source_entry_id": "2397cbe8-adf4-3f65-a360-795e76cb18a3",
                        "source_sense_id": "0d376f12-12d1-3f3c-ab26-a0935058f925",
                        "target_lang_word": "salted",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "salted",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2aac115-92d1-3101-b197-770f389f104a",
                                        "entry_id": "ab139b06-49a1-36d0-b6c3-15cce09fc092",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To which salt has been added."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8baaeaf-9986-4817-93ab-bf238c9461a1",
                                                "sense_id": "a2aac115-92d1-3101-b197-770f389f104a",
                                                "text": "salted peanuts"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf176fa2-76e4-4c7a-bbac-6d9ff1747045",
                                                "sense_id": "a2aac115-92d1-3101-b197-770f389f104a",
                                                "text": "Dave, if you are eating enough salted nuts for the salt in the nuts to make a difference in the compost pile, you would be better off worrying about what all those nuts are doing to *you* because that would be a *whole lotta nuts*!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b3932fe-89c8-351c-9d73-0b23d330b900",
                                        "entry_id": "ab139b06-49a1-36d0-b6c3-15cce09fc092",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of an animal, vaccinated against or having recovered from a disease."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "South-Africa",
                                            "archaic",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6335f5e-4809-4291-a618-5eee61907b67",
                                                "sense_id": "6b3932fe-89c8-351c-9d73-0b23d330b900",
                                                "text": "It is possible, again, that cases which have recovered from the disease (so-called salted animals), may assume the role of host, and furnish infective material for the propogation of the disease."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
